    "patch": "Omitted fields remain unchanged. Nullable fields may be explicitly cleared; non-nullable fields reject explicit null. Empty patches rejected.",
    "pagination": "Offset page/page_size with deterministic ID tie-breakers. Empty total_pages=0. Existing unpaginated arrays/tree remain arrays; no cursor API.",
    "dates": "ISO 8601 UTC with Z; stored naive SQL datetimes interpreted as UTC.",
    "media": "Authenticated filesystem JPEG/PNG transitional upload; R2 planned, not implemented.",
    "business": "Preserve ranking, UoW and outbox. Enforce post visibility on interactions. Serialize writes before commit where practical. Idempotent PUT membership, DELETE absent membership succeeds. Post moderation identical terminal decision ->200 without duplicate side effects; conflicting terminal decision ->409; same-state ban/unban no duplicate side effects.",
    "shared_types": [
      "PublicUserSummary",
      "UtcDateTime",
      "PaginationMeta",
      "ProblemDetails"
    ],
    "documentation": "Only documentation subagent writes docs/API_CONTRACT.md after integration; reconcile existing API docs."
  },
